    rdfs:label "Encounter: Arrived to in progress states" ;
    rdfs:comment "States of the Arrived to in progress path of the Encounter workflow, in order: arrived, in-progress. A transition is legal between adjacent states. The FHIR Encounter lifecycle: planned, arrived, triaged, in progress, on leave, finished, cancelled." ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml> ;
    sdc4-meta:isConstrainedByRmComponent <https://semanticdatacharter.com/ns/sdc4/sdc4.xsd#XdOrdinalType> .

